% TR-056 (Hattori, Yokoi, "The Concepts and Facilities of SIMPOS Supervisor", ICOT TR-056, 84.04)
% PDF page 08, printed folio 6. Section 3(2) list operations (cont.) and 3(3) 'Index' (signatures only).
% Transcribed by eye from 300dpi code-line crops (work/tr0056/m*.png), F2 2026-11-23. Courier font: punctuation clear.
% Interface lines are printed one per bullet item, each under an 'o To ...' description (given as % comments).

          :add_before(Pool,Object,Position)
% o To get an object at a position
          :get_at(Pool,Object,Position)
% o To remove an object at a position
          :remove_at(Pool,Object,Position)

% (3) Index
% o To add an object with a key
          :add_at(Pool,Object,Key)
% o To get an object with a key
          :get_at(Pool,Object,Key)
% o To remove an object with a key
          :remove(Pool,Object,Key)
